e\n-Play against the Knight in a medieval castle\n-Detailed chess move hint, novice friendly\n-Retro UI design\n-Undo function, no fear of mistakes\n-Great controller experience!\n\nWith frequent updates. the traditional chess experience as well as new features in conjunction with Quest2 will be provided.\n\nIncluding richer scenes, chess with friends, tournaments, real-time voice chat, fast chess and super fast chess, review analysis, chess timer, chess online, avatars, etc.\n\nDownload it now!", "short_description": "Play chess with computer or your phone? You're out of date!\n\nAlthough sitting on the sofa or lie in bed, you can still feel the ice-cold air in the medieval castle. Equipped with armour and sword , having a hearty game with friends! Conquering Knights stepwisely with your wisdom to reach the top of your Iron Throne!\n\nFeatures:\n-5 AI difficulty levels\n-Challenge the endgame\n-Immersive medieval castle\n-Move hint & Repentance, novice friendly\n-Great controller experience!\n\nDownload it now!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://chessvrgame.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SUPLIFE PTE", "support_website_url": "https://chessvrgame.com/contact", "website_url": "https://chessvrgame.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "PUZZLE", "STRATEGY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_